      },
      {
        "heading": "What does American Systems sell to the government?",
        "body": "Engineering Services accounted for $79.8M and Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences (except Nanotechnology and Biotechnology) accounted for $78M. Custom Computer Programming Services accounted for $22.6M and Computer Systems Design Services accounted for $20.5M. Other Computer Related Services accounted for $12.9M and Computer Facilities Management Services accounted for $11.5M."
      }
